{
  "title": "Surviving Romance",
  "description": "When Chaerin Eun becomes the protagonist of the romance novel she is reading, she expects a fairytale ending with the novel’s love interest, Jeha. But when a bizarre twist makes her realize the story is not playing out as it does in the book, she’ll need the help of an unlikely character from her class to defy the new storyline and find her happy ending -- if only she can figure out who this ‘Unknown Extra’ is first! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Anti-Hero, Apocalypse, Bullying, Delinquents, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Josei, Mystery, Psychological, School Life, Supernatural, Time Rewind, Viruses, 21st century, Acting, Attempted Suicide, Bad Reputation, Beautiful Female Lead, Body Horror, Deal with the Devil, Death, Death of Leading Characters, Depression, Ensemble Cast, Epidemic/Pandemic, Female Lead, Female Protagonist, Full Color, Future, Heterosexual, High School, Infectious Virus, Isekai, Isekai'd Into a Novel, Korean Folklore, Longstrip, Manhwa, Memories of Past Life, Modern Era, Obsessive Love, Pink-Haired Female Lead, Primarily Female Cast, Primarily Teen Cast, Reincarnated in a Book World, School, Sci-Fi, South Korea, Suicidal Character, Suspense, Teamwork, Time Loop, Time Manipulation, Time Travel, Tomboys, Torture, Transmigrated into a Book World, Transmigration, Trauma, Traumatic Past, Undead, Web Comic, Yandere, Age Regression, Apocalyptic Future, Corpses, Demons, Devil, Kill or Be Killed Situation, Soul, Survival of the Fittest, Thriller, Violence",
